cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this software supports your research, please cite it."
title: "korea-scholarship-mcp: an MCP server for the Korea Citation Index and Open Access Korea"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol stdio server exposing KCI (Korea Citation Index,
  National Research Foundation of Korea) and OAK (Open Access Korea, National
  Library of Korea) as eight tools. Four require no credentials. Responses use
  a typed envelope that reports script, matching mode, set breadth, harvest
  truncation and source-specific field asymmetries rather than smoothing them.
  Korean counterpart to cinii-mcp and jstage-mcp.
type: software
